			"summary": "\`M1\` is the engine page: its encoders edit the loaded engine's own parameters. \`shift + M1\` brings up the preset browser (by engine on OS 1.1.33, by category on OS 1.2: click \`E1\` for the engines), and loading one of an engine's presets changes the engine and the whole sound.",
