			"body": "The filter is a track's main tone control. Lower the cutoff to darken a sound, add resonance for a\\nsharper edge, and raise envelope amount so the filter envelope sweeps the cutoff on every note — the\\nclassic plucky bass. The shift layer of this page holds the track's sends, not filter settings.",
