			"body": "The kit page is where drumline is shaped as one instrument. Keep each key's character on \`M1\` and use\\n\`M2\` for what should apply to all of them: loosen the timing with funk, lengthen or tighten every\\ndecay, or add random across the whole kit. A kick that should be shorter alone is an \`M1\` change on\\nthat key; a whole kit that should be tighter is \`M2\` length.",
