			"body": "The blend control is the trick: set low, mid and high to an extreme curve — lows cut away for a\\nbreakdown, say — keep blend at zero, and bring it up when the moment comes. At low blend values the\\nEQ stays neutral whatever the bands say, which makes sweeps quick and repeatable on stage.",
