			"body": "The saturator adds density and warmth to the finished mix. Gain drives it, clip keeps peaks in check\\nand tone tilts the result darker or brighter; mix blends it with the clean signal, so heavy settings\\nwork in small doses. It sits after the EQ and before the compressor.",
